                                "sense_id": "755a9c4e-01c8-3142-969b-0b358d209d9b",
                                "text": "\"You guys are doing great. Ra ra ra! Go get 'em, guys.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94e96f7a-e1b5-4c8a-a33e-11a1b7b57aef",
                                "sense_id": "755a9c4e-01c8-3142-969b-0b358d209d9b",
                                "text": "Ra-ra and all that. So cheerleaders have a harder time climbing flights of stairs?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bfc4e3b-b268-457c-9c93-463fb9b29e9f",
                                "sense_id": "755a9c4e-01c8-3142-969b-0b358d209d9b",
                                "text": "\"Ra! Ra! You can do it! Ra! Ra! Just get to it!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
