                                "example_id": "27435aaa-7443-4f8a-9dc8-36315d2788bd",
                                "sense_id": "6e54f810-1341-3d79-bf6a-e1cc2e642c60",
                                "text": "Another one sung by Celtic fans is 'ooh ahh up the Ra', which is described as an Irish rebel song by some."
